{
  "requirement": "The `habeas-bootstrap-requirements` skill MUST direct agents to propose a distributed requirement for a cross-cutting convention instead of marking each of its sites with `{impl}`.",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "**Obligation.** `requirements.cli.distributed_guidance.bootstrap` has one obligation. The `habeas-bootstrap-requirements` skill MUST direct agents to propose a distributed requirement for a cross-cutting convention instead of marking each site `{impl}`. The requirement is about the skill's text, so only a test that reads that text and asserts the directive can check it.\n\n**Primary test.** `tests/authoring_cli.rs#fn[bootstrap_skill_proposes_distributed_requirements_for_conventions]` is marked `{test}` for the subject.\n- It reads the bootstrap skill's `SKILL.md` with `skill_md(\"habeas-bootstrap-requirements\")`.\n- It extracts the `## Proposing requirements` section with `section`. That helper panics if the heading is missing.\n- It asserts with `assert_text` that the section contains \"propose a distributed requirement instead of marking each site `{impl}`\". `assert_text` uses `text.contains`, so a missing or reworded directive fails the test.\n- The phrase carries both halves of the obligation: propose a distributed requirement, and do not mark each site `{impl}`. The check is scoped to the right skill and section, so text from another skill cannot satisfy it.\n\n**Supporting test.** `tests/authoring_cli.rs#fn[bundled_skills_refer_to_a_topic_home_instead_of_restating_it]` is also marked `{test}` for the subject. It asserts that the bootstrap skill refers to the habeas skill's `references/distributed-requirements.md`. It also asserts that the skill does not restate other skills' content.\n\n**Gaps.** There are no separate input classes, modes, or failure cases beyond the presence of this directive in the skill text. I found no unmarked relevant tests and no gaps. No `{fixme}` acknowledgments exist or are needed.",
  "references": "39dc45105e0a40ec372b4db8cb312f5b7afbfe3fed7cb755408213856659bdf6",
